        {"kind": "because", "text": "\\(0\\in\\mathbb Z\\)，且 \\(\\sqrt{2}\\notin\\mathbb Q\\)"},
        {"kind": "therefore", "text": "关系②、③错误，共有 2 个错误关系，选择 B"}
      ],
